WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Kriseva bridges defence and space procurement.
Two sides. One connected evidence trail.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
Paperwork slows both sides.
Requirements. Bids. Supporting evidence.

00:06.000 --> 00:10.000
TAS for suppliers.
Find tenders. Prepare your bid.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
Answers travel with evidence.
From requirement to source.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
Evaluator for buyers.
Check evidence. Review bids.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
People decide.
From paperwork to proof. On your premises.
